{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ink Strings is an easy to grasp, super satisfying and relaxingly zen-like puzzle odyssey about connecting the dots\u2026 and so much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious hand-painted world of the Conjured Isle, unravel the bitter-sweet tale of the Ink King, and discover hundreds of deep and surprising puzzles along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/extras/247e70aa5300a86cc38a4d943627a0f1.avif?t=1774405330\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrapping your head around each new gameplay mechanic is just the beginning. As mechanics start to interact in various elegant ways, approaching puzzles from multiple angles at once becomes key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/extras/a426ef4a2598663d602d328920816f5a.avif?t=1774405330\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual Sudoku fan or a seasoned thinky-gamer, the many different routes through the world of Ink Strings ensure that puzzle-lovers of all stripes can enjoy the game's many surprises in their own way and at their own pace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/extras/607a4d1031252454c17d202a3917eda3.avif?t=1774405330\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With several mysterious biomes to discover, there's always another path to tread, each with its own intriguing twists on the game's core mechanics to learn and master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/extras/b5775d0e13fa133880f3a0914a9e2a78.avif?t=1774405330\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758330?t=1774405330","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/04b05f1cdf56b826c316f3bc444923344666837a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774405330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/6e821f778dcebf3207572a0a2b5a16a61844dfc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774405330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/6e821f778dcebf3207572a0a2b5a16a61844dfc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774405330","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ink Strings is an easy to grasp, super satisfying and relaxingly zen-like puzzle odyssey about connecting the dots\u2026 and so much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious hand-painted world of the Conjured Isle, unravel the bitter-sweet tale of the Ink King, and discover hundreds of deep and surprising puzzles along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/extras/247e70aa5300a86cc38a4d943627a0f1.avif?t=1774405330\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrapping your head around each new gameplay mechanic is just the beginning. As mechanics start to interact in various elegant ways, approaching puzzles from multiple angles at once becomes key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/extras/a426ef4a2598663d602d328920816f5a.avif?t=1774405330\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual Sudoku fan or a seasoned thinky-gamer, the many different routes through the world of Ink Strings ensure that puzzle-lovers of all stripes can enjoy the game's many surprises in their own way and at their own pace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/extras/607a4d1031252454c17d202a3917eda3.avif?t=1774405330\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With several mysterious biomes to discover, there's always another path to tread, each with its own intriguing twists on the game's core mechanics to learn and master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/extras/b5775d0e13fa133880f3a0914a9e2a78.avif?t=1774405330\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["Tombobulus Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/a1785bf2641ee0dc2ec13e9d7ddde88a4ad024be/header.jpg?t=1774405330","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.11 (El Capitan) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4570 (4 * 3200) / Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 755M</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3758330/436361911/a839527bacd6abb5aff604887a82acb0b7463d2b/17622121